subsection.subsection:
Subsections (1)(a) and (b) apply to the following taxes, fees, or charges:
a tax under Title 10, Chapter 1, Part 3, Municipal Energy Sales and Use Tax Act;
a fee under Section 19-6-714;
a fee under Section 19-6-805;
a charge under Title 69, Chapter 2, Part 4, Prepaid Wireless Telecommunications Service Charges; or
a tax under this chapter.

A seller subject to Subsection (1) or a seller described in Subsection (4) may retain each month 1.31% of any amounts the seller is required to remit to the commission:
for a transaction described in Subsection 59-12-103(1) that is subject to a state tax and a local tax imposed in accordance with the following, for the month for which the seller is filing a return in accordance with Subsection (1):

Subsection 59-12-103(2)(a);
Subsection 59-12-103(2)(b); and
Subsection 59-12-103(2)(d); and
for an agreement sales and use tax.
